  "checked": null,
  "source": "Hymns Ancient and Modern, for use in the services of the Church, with accompanying tunes, ed. W. H. Monk (London: William Clowes and Sons; the standard edition of 1875, this copy printed 1889), Hymn 60, \"Mendelssohn\", pp. 76 to 77, in G, printed in minims (4/2) and written here in crotchets (4/4); verse 1 as printed on p. 77; the Amen left out; read from Princeton Theological Seminary Library's copy at archive.org/details/hmode00chur (scan pages n113 and n114), and checked against the 1875 printing of the same plates at archive.org/details/hymnsanci00chur (n111 and n112)"
